# What probe-tdx-initrd.sh brings back that does not belong in the tree.
#
# bootstate.tar snapshots are 65-132 MB each and unpacked/ is the same bytes
# again; they stay on the workstation, and pre-boot-state.txt beside each one
# lists the sha256 of every file grub reads, which is what a later run has to
# agree with. acquire-evidence is a built binary, and the bundle tarball is
# recoverable from the transcript.
*.tar
unpacked/
acquire-evidence
